{{!
    @template core_course/coursecard

    EJI ONE course card.

    Overrides core's card so it carries the pieces the brief asks for - image,
    title, category, progress and an explicit action - in the EJI card shape.

    The context is core's, unchanged: it comes from course_summary_exporter via
    block_myoverview, so enrolment, visibility, favourites and the progress
    figure are all decided by Moodle. The blocks that core defines ($menu,
    $progress, $coursename, $coursecategory) are still declared here, so
    block_myoverview's own overrides of them keep working.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id, fullname, shortname, viewurl, courseimage, visible
    * showshortname, showcoursecategory, uniqid

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 2,
        "fullname": "Leadership Fundamentals",
        "shortname": "LEAD-101",
        "viewurl": "/course/view.php?id=2",
        "courseimage": "",
        "visible": true,
        "showshortname": true,
        "uniqid": "abc123"
    }
}}
<div class="card course-card eji-course-card h-100" data-region="course-content" data-course-id="{{id}}">
    <a href="{{viewurl}}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="eji-course-card__imglink">
        <div class="card-img-top" style='background-image: url("{{{courseimage}}}");'>
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{fullname}}</span>
        </div>
    </a>
    <div class="card-body course-info-container" id="course-info-container-{{id}}-{{uniqid}}">
        {{#showshortname}}
            <div class="eji-course-card__shortname">
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}aria:courseshortname, core_course{{/str}}</span>
                {{{shortname}}}
            </div>
        {{/showshortname}}
        <a href="{{viewurl}}" class="aalink coursename eji-course-card__name">
            {{> core_course/favouriteicon }}
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}aria:coursename, core_course{{/str}}</span>
            {{$coursename}}{{fullname}}{{/coursename}}
        </a>
        <div class="eji-course-card__category">
            {{$coursecategory}}{{/coursecategory}}
        </div>
        {{^visible}}
            <div class="eji-course-card__badges">
                <span class="badge bg-info">{{#str}} hiddenfromstudents {{/str}}</span>
            </div>
        {{/visible}}
    </div>
    <div class="eji-course-card__foot">
        {{$progress}}{{/progress}}
        {{$menu}}{{/menu}}
    </div>
</div>
